@citisen/dsh-github-accelerator README · Install：Use `--profile web` instead of `--profile desktop` if you run the browser profile from
the CLI. `dsh` hot-reloads the profile, but fully quit and reopen the application if the
provider does not take effect.

@citisen/dsh-github-accelerator README · How it works：1. parses the URL and matches the hostname against `hosts`;
2. on a match, performs the request with `node:https`/`node:http` against the system
   resolver's answer, following same-origin redirects and applying the same body caps,
   charset decoding and `WEB_*` error codes as the built-in provider;
3. otherwise calls the provider registered under `http` and returns its result verbatim.
